    LLM: "Focus on collecting wild cards (3s and 9s). A 'natural' hand like a Straight is often useless against the high-powered hands of this variant.\n\nManage pot exposure when you have a face-up 3; decide when to match the pot or fold. Use position and visible wilds to size bets.\n\nRead opponents' possible hands from their upcards and the number of live 3s and 9s; balance bluffing with value when wilds are scarce.",
